Package: gojail
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Meng Zhuo <mengzhuo@iscas.ac.cn>
Homepage: https://github.com/mengzhuo/gojail
Depends: nftables
Conflicts: fail2ban
Description: Go implementation of fail2ban with nftables
 gojail monitors log files, counts failures and bans hosts using nftables.
 It provides fail2ban-style filter.d/action.d configuration, a control CLI
 and a systemd service. The package conflicts with fail2ban and requires
 nftables for packet filtering.
